{"data":{"Page":{"pageInfo":{"total":5000,"currentPage":1,"lastPage":1000,"hasNextPage":true,"perPage":5},"media":[{"id":195516,"idMal":61987,"title":{"romaji":"Kusuriya no Hitorigoto 3rd Season","english":"The Apothecary Diaries Season 3","native":"\u85ac\u5c4b\u306e\u3072\u3068\u308a\u3054\u3068 \u7b2c3\u671f"},"synonyms":[],"description":"In the aftermath of the Shi Clan\u2019s rebellion, things have finally settled down, and Maomao has returned to her old life as a pharmacist in the pleasure district.\n<br><br>\nOne day, triggered by a breakfast served at the Verdigris House, Maomao senses an anomaly and begins investigating its true nature.\n<br><br>\nMeanwhile, Jinshi, who has revealed his true identity as the Imperial brother and begun to face his heavy responsibilities, is deeply troubled by the final message left by Loulan: a warning of an impending \"disaster that will strike the nation.\"\n<br><br>\nTo make matters worse, rumors of a mysterious shrine maiden who deceives the people begin to spread, casting a dark shadow over the country of Li once again.\n<br><br>\nFrom the depths of the inner court to the city streets, and across foreign borders\u2014the world grows wider, and the stakes even higher for Maomao and Jinshi.\n<br><br>\n(Source: Crunchyroll News)","genres":["Drama","Mystery"],"format":"TV","status":"NOT_YET_RELEASED","episodes":null,"duration":null,"season":"FALL","seasonYear":2026,"startDate":{"year":2026,"month":10,"day":2},"endDate":{"year":null,"month":null,"day":null},"coverImage":{"extraLarge":"https:\/\/s4.anilist.co\/file\/anilistcdn\/media\/anime\/cover\/large\/bx195516-MJpUZlOberqH.jpg","large":"https:\/\/s4.anilist.co\/file\/anilistcdn\/media\/anime\/cover\/medium\/bx195516-MJpUZlOberqH.jpg","medium":"https:\/\/s4.anilist.co\/file\/anilistcdn\/media\/anime\/cover\/small\/bx195516-MJpUZlOberqH.jpg","color":"#e4a128"},"bannerImage":null,"siteUrl":"https:\/\/anilist.co\/anime\/195516","isAdult":false,"nextAiringEpisode":{"airingAt":1